OL,3,AFaisal Islam: What Jensen Huang told me
OL,4,Aabout China, national security and
OL,5,Apersuading Trump
OL,6,
OL,7,FJensen Huang has the air of the late
OL,8,FSteve Jobs about him. I have
OL,9,Finterviewed both, and the up-close
OL,10,Fcharisma - and occasionally scratchy
OL,11,Fgenius - is shared.
OL,13,FBoth sported a signature item of black
OL,14,Fclothing, although Huang opts for a
OL,15,Fleather jacket rather than the Apple
OL,16,Ffounder's turtle neck.
OL,18,FHowever, Huang, who is now being
OL,19,Finvestigated over an affair with an
OL,20,Falleged Chinese spy, is far more
OL,21,Fimportant to the future of the world
OL,22,Forder than Jobs.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
